      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Blackjack Table</b>: a port of <b>VRCBlackjack</b> v1.0.4 by CentauriCore
    (Centauri). Copyright 2022 CentauriCore. Source: github.com/Centauri2442/VRCBlackjack.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0);
    distributed on an "AS IS" basis, without warranties or conditions of any kind.
    Changed for Altspace (the rules translated to TypeScript, the table synced as
    state, a fair shared deal, URP materials, new fonts and cards, the felt''s 2
    to 1 line and logo painted out): see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES in the port.

    Table
    model: Sentinel373. Table textures: FiyCsf. Sounds: Casino Audio and Interface
    Sounds by Kenney (www.kenney.nl), CC0.

    Cards: Boardgame Pack v2 by Kenney
    (www.kenney.nl), CC0. Fonts: Cinzel and Cinzel Decorative (Natanael Gama, the
    Cinzel Project Authors), Limelight (Sorkin Type Co), Liberation Sans: SIL Open
    Font License 1.1.

    Every win pays 1 to 1. The script also holds the portkit
    runtime (MIT). Not affiliated with VRChat or CentauriCore. Click to close.'
